OL,3,CFootball pitch to be built in honour
OL,4,Cof teenage player stabbed to death
OL,6,FRachel Bullock spoke to Tomasz
OL,7,FOleszak's former club about the
OL,8,Fannouncement
OL,10,FAn artificial pitch is to be built in
OL,11,Fhonour of a football-loving teenager
OL,12,Fwho was stabbed to death.
OL,14,FThe 3G pitch will be built in
OL,15,FGateshead in the memory of Tomasz
OL,16,FOleszak following a #868,000 grant
OL,17,Ffrom the Football Foundation ` a
OL,18,Fcharity backed by the Premier League,
OL,19,Fthe FA and the Government.
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G1/4
