CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F395A1784224088
OL,3,CFootball pitch to be built in honour
OL,4,Cof teenage player stabbed to death
OL,6,FTomasz was just 14 when he was stabbed
OL,7,Fto death in 2022 by a 15-year-old who
OL,8,Fshouted in triumph after he carried
OL,9,Fout the fatal attack. The killer was
OL,10,Fjailed for life in 2023.
OL,12,FFor much of his childhood, Tomasz
OL,13,Fplayed football for Gateshead
OL,14,FCleveland Hall Community Association.
OL,16,FThe club will now build a floodlit
OL,17,Fartificial pitch at its premises at
OL,18,FBeacon Lough and this will allow the
OL,19,Forganisation to expand into disability
OL,20,Fand walking football.
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G2/4
OL,2,W/*%+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'R(,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
