FL,396,420,250,120,000,100
PN,39503
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F395A1784224088
OL,3,CFootball pitch to be built in honour
OL,4,Cof teenage player stabbed to death
OL,6,FThe pitch will also be exclusively
OL,7,Fused by women's and girls' teams on
OL,8,Fone day of the week.
OL,10,FAndrew Watling, leader of Gateshead
OL,11,FCleveland Hall CA, said: "The loss of
OL,12,FTomasz hit everyone at our club
OL,13,Fextremely hard.
OL,15,F"I am delighted that the Football
OL,16,FFoundation have chosen to support our
OL,17,Fproject to build a lasting monument to
OL,18,Fhis memory and a permanent reminder of
OL,19,Fthe horrendous consequences of knife
OL,20,Fcrime.
OL,26,@sD@ZOUwD@AOU
