PN,39504
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F395A1784224088
OL,3,CFootball pitch to be built in honour
OL,4,Cof teenage player stabbed to death
OL,6,F"The pitch will provide the
OL,7,Fopportunity for thousands of
OL,8,Fyoungsters to participate in sport
OL,9,Fover the decades to come."
OL,11,FKim McGuinness, North East Mayor,
OL,12,Fsaid: "This pitch will stand as a
OL,13,Ftribute to Tomasz ` a young boy who
OL,14,Floved his football and his club.
OL,16,F"His loss is still felt deeply in the
OL,17,Flocal community, but it's right that
OL,18,Fhis memory will live on here, in a
OL,19,Fplace that brings people together and
OL,20,Fhelps the next generation grow, on and
OL,21,Foff the pitch."
